<title>USA: Upland Energy allowed to complete well.</title>
<headline>Upland Energy allowed to complete well.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Upland Energy Corp said Friday it recently received approval from the Corporation Commission of Kansas to complete the Lewis H-1 well in its Hittle Field in Southern Kansas.</p>
<p>Once the well is placed into production, the company said it intends to drill additional wells in the Hittle Field where it recently acquired additional acreage.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
